--------------------------------------------
- `plan-main.ts` (prompt id `plan.main`) is Otter-authored text moved verbatim from `src/hosts/plan-conversation.ts`; it is not copied from GJC. The only GJC influence is the pinned plan-then-separate-human-approval shape recorded in `test/fixtures/gjc-keys-8cd17c0.json`.
